# Satoru, the Infiltrator (menace) draws for nothing here: Satoru and then Invasion Reinforcements are each cast with
# mana spent on them (CR 601.2h), so "no mana was spent to cast them" is false for them, and the Ally token Reinforcements
# makes is a token, not a nontoken creature, so it does not count (CR 111.1). Bot1 keeps one Island in hand throughout: a
# draw would make it two cards.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Satoru, the Infiltrator
Invasion Reinforcements
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

